[h1]Cheaper Building Multiplayer B42[/h1]

Building a base in Build 42 eats an enormous amount of material. This mod cuts the cost of every construction you place from the Building menu, and speeds up how long each one takes to build.

Works in singleplayer and multiplayer. Server owners only need the mod on the server and in the mod list — no client-side setup beyond subscribing.

[h2]Summary[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Build times cut by 75%[/b] on everything the mod touches.
[*][b]Most materials drop to 1.[/b]
[*][b]Large builds stay meaningful[/b] — double doors, double gates, stairs and masonry keep a reduced but non-trivial cost.
[*][b]Tools are untouched.[/b] You still need your hammer, saw, mason's trowel and blowtorch, and they degrade as normal.
[*][b]Skill and XP requirements are untouched.[/b] Carpentry 6 still means Carpentry 6.
[/list]

